      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Waitsfield%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Unlike many other towns in central Vermont, Waitsfield was bypassed by the railroad during the state's transportation expansion.",
